Historical diagnostic source
============================

These scripts preserve earlier geometry, common/local partition, midplane
symmetry, quadrature, and NRCCIE investigations. They are not the current
test suite. Several depend on retired functions or saved MAT files and
cannot be run against the current leaves module without adaptation.

In particular, older scripts use build_leaf_geometry, the common/local
quadrature helpers, apply_nrccie, leaf_midplane_permutation, or
fourfold_expand_quad_corr. Those interfaces are intentionally not restored
by this archive. Consult Git history when reproducing a historical study.
Recorded results, plots, and logs remain local and are not included here.

Current examples are leaves/test/nrccie_scattering_matrix_leaf.m and the
functions under test/ellipsoid/. See leaves/README and
test/ellipsoid/README_toy_rehearsal for their supported workflows.
